          "explanation": "Doctor gives a usable question list to overcome fragmented phone-result visibility.",
          "quote": "医生来了，你可以这样问"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "Triggered by the phone report not opening and mixed result stream. The doctor gave screenshots/briefing and a structured question list for the inpatient physician, making the plan feasible in the ward setting.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
